<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money market shortage below 9 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money market shortage below 9 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage fell to 8.937 billion rand on Tuesday from 9.842 billion rand on Monday, the Reserve Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
